{"name": "Lionized", "pages": [{"name": "Lionized", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"format": 1, "content": "<p>Lionized</p><ul><li>Whenever you cause a creature to become lionized, choose one of its attributes (Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom, Presence) to extol. The lionized creature can add a bonus 1d4 to the result of attack rolls and checks that use the chosen attribute.&nbsp;</li><li>Lionized does not stack. If a creature gains the lionized condition while already lionized, the effect with the longer duration remains. When this happens, it can also change which attribute is affected.</li></ul>", "markdown": ""}, "_id": "KYOEYE0M3E9XAQ1G", "image": {}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {"default": -1}, "flags": {}}], "ownership": {"default": 0}, "folder": null, "sort": 0, "_id": "ZOBZ8V2YME5YOYZR", "_stats": {"systemId": "undertaking", "systemVersion": "1.0.0", "coreVersion": "11.304"}}
{"name": "Villainized", "pages": [{"name": "Villainized", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"format": 1, "content": "<p>Villainized</p><ul><li>Whenever a villainized creature takes damage, it suffers 1d6 additional psychic damage. It cannot take this damage again until it performs a hostile action.</li><li>Villainized creatures have disadvantage on Presence (Persuasion) checks.</li><li>Villainized does not stack. If a creature gains the villainized condition while already villainized, only the effect with the longer remaining duration remains.</li></ul>", "markdown": ""}, "_id": "ADTSW8R6K1YAMW44", "image": {}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {"default": -1}, "flags": {}}], "ownership": {"default": 0}, "folder": null, "sort": 0, "_id": "WHN3T2G6R8HUKOQX", "_stats": {"systemId": "undertaking", "systemVersion": "1.0.0", "coreVersion": "11.304"}}
